  "releaseNotes": "v1.6.2 — Lockstep release with RedoxNet.Mcp.LsOpenApi 1.6.2. TR catalog adds t8451 ((통합) 주식차트 일주월년 API용; 76→77 TRs): t8410's InBlock plus exchgubun (K/N/U), same OutBlock shape, body continuation on cts_date. It is the only working source of KR year bars, because t8410 returns no rows for gubun=5. No API changes. See https://github.com/redoxnet/mcp-lsopenapi/blob/main/RELEASENOTES.Core.md for full notes.",
